sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Guest
    participant AUTH as AuthController
    participant API as HotelBookingController
    participant BS as BookingService
    participant INV as InventoryRepository
    participant PS as PricingService
    participant ST as Stripe

    U->>AUTH: POST /auth/login
    AUTH-->>U: access token, refresh cookie
    Note over U,ST: Browsing is public. Everything below requires Authorization: Bearer

    U->>API: POST /bookings/init
    API->>BS: initialiseBooking()
    BS->>INV: findAndLockAvailableInventory()
    Note over INV: PESSIMISTIC_WRITE lock on every date row
    INV-->>BS: locked rows
    BS->>BS: row count must equal night count
    BS->>INV: initBooking, reservedCount increases
    BS->>PS: calculateTotalPrice()
    PS-->>BS: price from the decorator chain
    BS-->>U: RESERVED, held for 10 minutes

    U->>API: POST /bookings/{id}/addGuests
    API->>BS: ownership, expiry and state checks
    BS-->>U: GUESTS_ADDED

    U->>API: POST /bookings/{id}/payments
    BS->>ST: create Checkout Session
    ST-->>BS: session URL and session id
    BS-->>U: redirect URL, PAYMENTS_PENDING

    U->>ST: completes payment
    ST->>API: POST /webhook/payment, signed
    API->>BS: capturePayment(event)
    BS->>INV: findAndLockReservedInventory()
    BS->>INV: confirmBooking, reserved becomes booked
    BS-->>ST: 204 No Content
    Note over U: CONFIRMED
